        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "refactor: consolidate duration parsing and formatting",
        "body": "Closes #105985\n\n## What Problem This Solves\n\nOpenClaw had four duration parsers and many independent formatters across core, the Control UI, plugins, and repository scripts. Their unit support and rounding differed, producing inconsistent user-visible labels and duplicated maintenance.\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n\n- Pins `ms` and `pretty-ms` at the root for core, UI, scripts, and the internalized Phone Control plugin.\n- Adds plugin-local `pretty-ms` dependencies where independently packaged plugins own the runtime import.\n- Preserves the existing composite parser grammar (`1h30m`, `2m500ms`) in one thin core facade while delegating tokens to `ms`.\n- Moves generic duration display to shared `pretty-ms`-backed helpers and removes replaced parsing/formatting branches.\n- Retains contract-specific output, including fixed-seconds protocol strings and localized onboarding labels.\n\nThis is net 95 source/generated lines smaller across the full diff.\n\n## User Impact\n\nCLI, Control UI, plugin, and diagnostic duration labels now use consistent units and rounding. Existing composite CLI inputs continue to work. Activity, Logbook, profile, sessions, and workboard rendering tests pin the intended compact strings.\n\n## Evidence\n\n- Testbox `tbx_01kxcsv0kxe0hjsjbt7vrnpt7y`: 438 focused tests passed across 9 Vitest shards on the final base.\n- Testbox `tbx_01kxctmw1mfa2fdkzccdye44zv`: 44 build-all tooling tests passed after preserving compound minute/second precision.\n- Testbox `tbx_01kxcrsbvmk0tpps86cvw41vd2`: `pnpm build` passed; full core, plugin, and script lint passed with 0 errors/warnings.\n- Dependency checks passed: direct pins, root ownership, patches, and all 76 generated shrinkwraps.\n- Plugin SDK API baseline, export sync, surface gate, A2UI sync, import-cycle, database-store, media-helper, and runtime-sidecar gates passed.\n- Source-blind CLI behavior validation confirmed `1h30m` and `2m500ms` reach the normal gateway boundary while malformed `1h30` is rejected.\n- `git diff --check` passed.\n\nKnown unrelated current-`main` proof gaps:\n\n- Full extension test typecheck reproduces on clean `origin/main` at `extensions/qa-lab/src/suite.test.ts:552` because the fixture lacks `artifactPointerPath` and `generation`.\n- The repository-wide LOC ratchet currently reports unrelated files already above their baseline. Touched large-file baselines were ratcheted downward and none of the touched files appear in that failure set.\n\nNo screenshot: this changes compact text labels only; rendered DOM/unit tests cover every changed Control UI surface.\n\nAI-assisted implementation and review; maintainer-authored change.\n",
